  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gBbFK1h.png\" width=\"1315\" height=\"685\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCc_kqzt253fnG2RHW_CZL2A\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCc_kqzt253fnG2RHW_CZL2A?label=Youtube&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"138\" height=\"22\"></a><a href=\"https://twitter.com/sketch_macaw\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/- -ffffff\" width=\"15\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/sketch_macaw?color=6eb7ec&label=Twitter&logo=twitter&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"119\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/- -ffffff\" width=\"15\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/Jmpdj8W\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/645360921673465857?color=a97db2&logo=discord&logoColor=f&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"181\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/sketchmacaw/MacawsModsIssues/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/- -ffffff\" width=\"15\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-Crafting Recipes-bc8f56?style=for-the-badge\" width=\"154\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GUtHhCc.png\" alt=\"蓝线\" width=\"1920\" height=\"17\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/A1pclRa.png\" alt=\"关于\" width=\"162\" height=\"43\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">我们都知道 Minecraft 需要更多风格化的栅栏、墙和门。好吧，我想我有好消息要告诉你！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 该模组添加了新的木栅栏、木门、石墙、石门以及会造成伤害的特殊铁丝网栅栏。最新的 1.1.0 版本新增了石柱墙、<br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">草顶石墙以及碰撞时会造成伤害的拒马（Cheval de Frise）！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 欢迎在评论区或我们的 Macaw Discord 服务器中提出你的建议。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GUtHhCc.png\" alt=\"蓝线\" width=\"1920\" height=\"17\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zQ7I8me.png\" alt=\"视频\" width=\"340\" height=\"47\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">最新栅栏模组视频展示</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/g3V3lcidXmU?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/mqOR-HOaI68?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fsketchmacaw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Macaw/BH_MxBH_PromoCard.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"647\" height=\"144\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">需要服务器吗？点击上方图片，使用代码 <strong>sketchmacaw</strong> 首月可享 <strong>25%</strong> 折扣，尽情游玩吧！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GUtHhCc.png\" alt=\"蓝线\" width=\"1920\" height=\"17\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EpKoS1L.png\" alt=\"常见问题\" width=\"163\" height=\"50\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Q：是否有计划向后移植到 1.15.2 及更低版本？</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">A：可能性极低</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Q：我可以在我的整合包中使用你们的模组吗？</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">A：可以，只需注明出处并附上 CurseForge 页面链接即可</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Q：我有一份翻译稿，应该发到哪里给你们？</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">A：可以发送到 GitHub 或我们的 Discord 服务器</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BOmxXoM.jpg\" width=\"1903\" height=\"2399\"></p>",
